# ORCA_UX_PROBE for pplus-ranked.txt: stock rules, 1 stock (gmSetRule 0x9017F360 +2 mode, +4
# stocks), and the stage select's selection (+0x248, a page-0 position of the 2024 Proposed preset:
# 4 Temple of Time, 5 Smashville, 6 Battlefield, 8 Luigi's Mansion) before each strike or pick.
@scSelctCharacter 30 write 9017f362 01
@scSelctCharacter 30 write 9017f364 01
@scSelStage:1 100 write [[[805a0060]+4]+3ac]+248 00000005
@scSelStage:1 140 write [[[805a0060]+4]+3ac]+248 00000006
@scSelStage:1 170 write [[[805a0060]+4]+3ac]+248 00000004
@scSelStage:1 200 write [[[805a0060]+4]+3ac]+248 00000008
@* 0 watch [[[805a0060]+4]+3ac]+244 hovered
@* 0 watch [[[805a0060]+4]+3ac]+248 selected
@* 0 watch 8042c824 strikes
@* 0 watch 90180f38 stage
